!!! archon/model/rule.mat
!!! A knowledge rule: one thing Archon knows how to look for.
!!!
!!! A rule carries its own severity, confidence and category so a finding
!!! inherits a complete assessment from the rule that produced it. `needle` is
!!! the literal the first analyzer looks for; later analyzers interpret rules
!!! with structure rather than a substring.

book archon.model.rule

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from archon.model.severity
read everything from archon.model.confidence
read everything from archon.model.category

public knowledge-rule begin record
    field identity as text
    field title as text
    field needle as text
    field guidance as text
    field level as severity
    field certainty as confidence
    field domain as category
end record
